<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
  <title>Event Confirmation - Tiger Invites</title>
  <!--[if mso]>
  <noscript>
    <xml>
      <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
        <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
      </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
    </xml>
  </noscript>
  <![endif]-->
  <style type="text/css">
    /* Reset styles for email clients */
    body, table, td, p, a, li, blockquote {
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100% !important;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      color: #333333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    
    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
    }
    
    img {
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
      border: 0;
      height: auto;
      line-height: 100%;
      outline: none;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    /* Container styling */
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dddddd;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    /* Header section */
    .header {
      background-color: #166fa1; /* Changed from gradient to solid color */
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 25px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #0d506e;
    }
    
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    /* Content section */
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
    }
    
    .content p {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    
    /* Event details section */
    .event-details {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border-left: 4px solid #1f90d1;
      margin: 25px 0;
    }
    
    .event-details h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #166fa1;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    
    .event-details ul {
      list-style-type: none;
      padding-left: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .event-details li {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      padding-left: 20px;
      position: relative;
    }
    
    .event-details li:before {
      content: "•";
      color: #1f90d1;
      font-weight: bold;
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
    }
    
    /* Button styling */
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    
    .confirm-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      background-color: #1f90d1;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #166fa1;
      mso-hide: all;
    }
    
    /* Footer section */
    .footer {
      background-color: #f0f0f0;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666666;
      border-top: 1px solid #dddddd;
    }
    
    .footer a {
      color: #1f90d1;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .footer-links {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .footer-links a {
      margin: 0 10px;
    }
    
    .physical-address {
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    
    /* Responsive adjustments */
    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        width: 100% !important;
        border-radius: 0;
        border: none;
      }
      
      .content {
        padding: 20px !important;
      }
      
      .header {
        padding: 20px 15px !important;
      }
      
      .header h1 {
        font-size: 24px !important;
      }
      
      .confirm-button {
        display: block !important;
        margin: 0 auto !important;
        padding: 12px 20px !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- PREHEADER TEXT (Hidden) -->
  <div style="display: none; max-height: 0px; overflow: hidden;">
    Thank you for confirming your attendance for {{eventName}} on {{eventDate}} at {{eventTime}}.
  </div>
  <!-- END PREHEADER -->
  
  <center>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Event Confirmation</h1>
      </div>
      
      <div class="content">
        <p>Dear <strong>{{guestName}}</strong>,</p>
        
        <p>Thank you for confirming your attendance. We're excited to have you join us for <strong>{{eventName}}</strong>.</p>
        
        <div class="event-details">
          <h3>Event Details</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{eventDate}}</li>
            <li><strong>Time:</strong> {{eventTime}}</li>
            <li><strong>Venue:</strong> {{eventVenue}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p>Please keep this email as your confirmation. A reminder will be sent one day before the event.</p>
        
        <p>If you would like to edit or update your details or add additional guest names, please click the button below.</p>
        
        <div class="button-container">
          <a href="https://tigerinvites.com/edit?id={{id}}" class="confirm-button">Edit Your Details</a>
        </div>
        
        <p>We look forward to welcoming you.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br><strong>{{organizerName}}</strong></p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="https://tigerinvites.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> | 
          <a href="https://tigerinvites.com/terms">Terms of Service</a> | 
          <a href="https://tigerinvites.com/unsubscribe?id={{id}}">Unsubscribe</a>
        </div>
        <div class="physical-address">
          Tiger Invites<br>
          123 Main Street, Suite 456<br>
          New York, NY 10001, USA
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
          &copy; 2023 Tiger Invites. All rights reserved.<br>
          This email was sent to you because you registered for an event on our platform.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </center>
</body>
</html>